# Old /articles/ URLs, kept working.
#
# The section was renamed Articles -> Essays on 2026-11-23 and the URLs moved with it.
# The first essay was published that same day, so links to /articles/... are already out
# and cannot be edited after the fact. These rules make them land on the right page.
# Never delete them.
#
# Cloudflare Workers parses this file and applies it to static assets before the Worker
# runs (the Worker only serves /api/subscribe). Static rules must come before wildcards.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/

/articles     /essays/        301
/articles/    /essays/        301
/articles/*   /essays/:splat  301
